           name  its  location,  such  as  _/_u_s_r_/_s_h_a_r_e_/_t_e_r_m_i_n_f_o_._d_b, rather than
           _/_u_s_r_/_s_h_a_r_e_/_t_e_r_m_i_n_f_o_/.

       The hashed database uses less disk space and is a  little  faster  than
